/*
 * Implements compile-time evaluation of conditional blocks and assertions
 * inside class declarations.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of class-level conditional blocks(`if constexpr`-style),
 *   - compile-time evaluation of condition expressions,
 *   - selective inclusion of inner declarations based on condition results,
 *   - validation of compile-time assertions inside classes,
 *   - prevention of repeated validation via areCondBlockDeclsValidated flag.
 *
 * Conditional blocks and assertions are processed before layout validation
 * and before method/constructor finalization. They determine which members
 * of a class actually exist in the final semantic
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::class_::cte_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/class_/cte_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-27
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
